# CES-011 to CES-013 – upload a bulk file, check row results, submit, track

Start /bulk
Scope /bulk
Exclude /prototype /prototype-admin /assets /bulk/template.csv
Tags bulk CES-011 CES-012 CES-013

--- Setup ---

Use setup.clinical-admin

--- Map ---

Visit /bulk
ClickLink "upload a file"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
Goto /bulk/prototype-upload
Snapshot
WaitForSelector "text=check the results for your file"
Snapshot
ClickLink "Continue"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
ClickButton "submit bulk file"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
ClickLink "check progress"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
Wait 9000
Goto /bulk
ClickLink "B-2026-0013"
Wait 1200
Snapshot
